<title>INDIA: India's RBI says repo cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI says repo cut-off unchanged at 5.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Reserve Bank of India (RBI) on Saturday said the cut-off rate for the repo auction was unchanged at 5.0 percent.</p>
<p>It received ten bids for 10.90 billion rupees, of which it accepted seven bids amounting to 10.50 billion rupees. The weighted average rate was 4.9702 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
